e info for melee classes</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#eeffee'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=10'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><A href='http://eq.stratics.com' target='new'>EQ Stratics</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#ddeedd'>General info on EQ</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=4'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#eeffee'><A href='http://www.eq-uk.com' target='new'>EQ UK</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#eeffee'>General site for the UK EQ-playing community.  Run by our very own Khelor</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#eeffee'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=11'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><A href='http://www.geocities.com/copelandeq/weaponanalyzer.html' target='new'>EQ Weapon Analyzer</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#ddeedd'>Windows app that analyzes damage output of different weapon combos - very useful</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=24'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#eeffee'><A href='http://www.battlezinc.com/eqwdb/default.asp' target='new'>EQ Weapons & Armour Database</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#eeffee'>Quality & updated database</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#eeffee'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=18'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><A href='http://www.gameznet.com/eq/' target='new'>EQLizer</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#ddeedd'></TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=8'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#eeffee'><A href='http://www.everlore.com' target='new'>Everlore</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#eeffee'>Good player-info site</TD><TD width='12%' align='right' bgcolor='#eeffee'><a href='uu_brokenlink.asp?id=3'>Mark Broken</A></TD></TR><TR><TD width='25%' bgcolor='#ddeedd'><A href='http://www.everquestraids.com' target='new'>Everquest Raids (Rordin's)</A></TD><TD bgcolor='#ddeedd'>Find